{'symbol': 'CPT', 'date': '2022-03-29 18:43:00', 'title': 'CAMDEN PROPERTY TRUST SET TO JOIN S&P 500; MATADOR RESOURCES TO JOIN S&P MIDCAP 400; VIR BIOTECHNOLOGY TO JOIN S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': "NEW YORK , MARCH 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P MIDCAP 400 CONSTITUENT CAMDEN PROPERTY TRUST (NYSE: CPT) WILL REPLACE PEOPLE'S UNITED FINANCIAL INC. (NASD: PBCT) IN THE S&P 500, S&P SMALLCAP 600 CONSTITUENT MATADOR RESOURCES CO. (NYSE: MTDR) WILL REPLACE CAMDEN PROPERTY TRUST IN THE S&P MIDCAP 400 AND VIR BIOTECHNOLOGY, INC. (NASD: VIR) WILL REPLACE MATADOR RESOURCES IN THE S&P SMALLCAP 600 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON MONDAY, APRIL 4.\xa0 S&P 500 CONSTITUENT M&T BANK CORP. (NYSE: MTB) IS ACQUIRING PEOPLE'S UNITED FINANCIAL IN A DEAL EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED ON OR ABOUT APRIL 4."}